lumsy-Angel-🌧)~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7721.99, "timestamp": "02:08:41", "text": "彼と一緒に死ぬつもりだ。それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7724.55, "timestamp": "02:08:44", "text": "爆発する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7725.51, "timestamp": "02:08:45", "text": "何が起こるか見てみましょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7727.189, "timestamp": "02:08:47", "text": "ゼノン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7730.229, "timestamp": "02:08:50", "text": "こんにちは、ドジっ子さん。配信へようこ​​そ。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7733.189, "timestamp": "02:08:53", "text": "どうすればいいのかわからない。ああ、つまりあなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7734.75, "timestamp": "02:08:54", "text": "にたどり着くために"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7738.629, "timestamp": "02:08:58", "text": "トラック。待て、誰かが生きていた。はい、"}]